        "text": "=Create exactly three coherent editorial image prompts for this article. Slots must be exactly HERO_IMAGE, IMAGE_2, IMAGE_3, one each.\nARTICLE_HTML: {{ $(\"Check Article HTML Validity\").item.json.article_html_template }}\nIMAGE_STYLE: {{ $(\"Set Blog Input Fields\").item.json.IMAGE_STYLE }}\nOPTIONAL HERO HINT: {{ $(\"Set Blog Input Fields\").item.json.IMAGE_PROMPT_1_BASE }}\nOPTIONAL IMAGE 2 HINT: {{ $(\"Set Blog Input Fields\").item.json.IMAGE_PROMPT_2_BASE }}\nOPTIONAL IMAGE 3 HINT: {{ $(\"Set Blog Input Fields\").item.json.IMAGE_PROMPT_3_BASE }}\nUse clean composition and useful editorial imagery. Avoid logos, watermarks, fabricated evidence and misleading before/after claims. Return structured output only.",
        "batching": {
